WEBVTT

01:00.390 --> 01:07.230
It is said that 70% of the
human brain's capacity is unused.

01:09.230 --> 01:11.290
It's also thought that...

01:11.870 --> 01:15.070
...the mysterious powers that humans
have are hidden in this part of the brain.

01:17.010 --> 01:21.570
The 70% of the brain that is not used...

01:22.350 --> 01:24.070
...is often called this...

01:24.150 --> 01:29.880
<i>Night Head Genesis</i>

01:41.330 --> 01:46.290
Meaning Futami's consciousness and
his body are totally within the network?

01:46.370 --> 01:49.530
Yeah, and he is trying
to tell us something.

01:53.040 --> 01:54.980
Night Head Project?

01:56.810 --> 01:57.780
What is it?

01:58.550 --> 02:02.080
Isn't this the list of psychic
power holders that Ark has?

02:03.390 --> 02:04.510
Reiko Hirose...

02:06.320 --> 02:08.880
Amazing. They have
everything from personal history...

02:08.960 --> 02:11.290
...to medical records and
psychoanalysis results looked up!

02:11.360 --> 02:13.190
What're these names?

02:13.330 --> 02:14.920
"Elimination target"?

02:15.070 --> 02:16.050
That's right!

02:16.130 --> 02:18.120
They're the girls that
Reiko Hirose murdered!

02:19.070 --> 02:22.870
In here, there were power holders
that this company didn't want!

02:23.410 --> 02:25.070
Then maybe...

02:27.140 --> 02:28.080
<i>Masayuki Yushima</i>

02:27.610 --> 02:28.770
There he is!

02:29.250 --> 02:32.840
Then, within the high school
kids that were killed, there was...

02:32.920 --> 02:34.710
Kamiya's name is there too.

02:34.780 --> 02:37.280
Then all the incidents
were planned here!

02:37.490 --> 02:40.550
They said Okuhara the director
has the power of foresight.

02:40.620 --> 02:44.360
They looked up the people that are
going to become a hindrance to the future.

02:44.430 --> 02:47.290
Then they brought them to their
death without them realizing it.

02:47.360 --> 02:49.590
On top of that,
they can't be judged by law.

02:50.870 --> 02:53.360
That's Ark's true character!

02:53.900 --> 02:57.470
But why weren't our names on there.

02:58.070 --> 02:59.410
We were protected.

02:59.480 --> 03:00.570
By Shouko?

03:00.640 --> 03:04.600
Yeah, and by the power that
came from where Shouko went.

03:09.390 --> 03:11.350
I beg you, help me...

03:12.060 --> 03:13.220
Futami, is that you?

03:14.360 --> 03:16.520
Protect that child.

03:16.660 --> 03:19.250
<i>I'll be waiting at the cape.</i>

03:19.800 --> 03:22.090
I'll be waiting at the cape.

03:22.970 --> 03:24.270
<i>Dream</i>

03:24.270 --> 03:28.100
<i>Dream
Episode 19</i>

03:48.060 --> 03:49.050
Damn it!

03:49.130 --> 03:50.990
Where did you go, Futami?

04:07.540 --> 04:08.980
It's that girl?

04:09.380 --> 04:10.180
Yeah...

04:11.080 --> 04:13.740
She knows that it's
going to rain soon.

04:14.250 --> 04:17.690
She's contemplating if she
should tell the teacher or not.

04:18.620 --> 04:23.680
She's starting to realize that she's
the only one that knows things like that.

04:24.890 --> 04:26.790
What's going to happen to her?

04:27.900 --> 04:31.130
She'll most likely experience pain...

04:31.670 --> 04:34.900
...but nothing like
what happened to us.

04:35.670 --> 04:36.830
I see...

04:37.140 --> 04:39.370
It's different from our era.

04:39.610 --> 04:42.810
By the time that girl
becomes older, most likely...

04:43.880 --> 04:47.410
It will most likely be
a better era than now.

04:57.330 --> 04:59.960
Why do you think it is, Brother?

05:01.770 --> 05:07.260
Sadness and pain will always
continue to exist in the human world.

05:07.800 --> 05:11.540
If you use words,
you can explain it in any way.

05:12.310 --> 05:17.110
But right now, I'm not in a mental
state of wanting to use any words.

05:17.850 --> 05:19.180
It's strange...

05:19.320 --> 05:24.480
Quiet days like this are continuing,
but I can't rest at all.

05:25.460 --> 05:29.520
The worry of being chased by
something is with me all the time.

05:44.810 --> 05:48.340
To Manila. Please, I really
need to be on the next flight.

05:48.610 --> 05:50.080
I'm very sorry.

05:50.480 --> 05:52.640
Unfortunately, the next flight is full.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.150
Then I'll wait for a cancellation!

05:54.220 --> 05:58.480
Even if you want to,
it's 20 minutes till departure.

05:58.560 --> 06:03.720
I would be glad to get you a seat
on the next flight in about two hours.

06:04.030 --> 06:06.960
Regardless, I'll wait
for a cancellation. Please!

06:08.400 --> 06:09.230
Sir!

06:11.030 --> 06:12.730
Please answer, Futami...

06:22.910 --> 06:23.880
Damn!

06:23.950 --> 06:25.140
Mr. Tsuzuki...

06:27.420 --> 06:28.940
Thank you for waiting.

06:29.220 --> 06:31.450
I was able to get you
a cancellation just now.

06:31.620 --> 06:35.490
It's eight minutes to departure,
so please hurry to the boarding gate.

06:35.560 --> 06:37.030
T-Thank you!

07:01.620 --> 07:06.610
Sir, we are going to be taking off
shortly, so please fasten your seatbelt.

07:06.690 --> 07:07.920
Ah, yes...

07:22.670 --> 07:26.110
The plane has now
taken off from Narita airport.

07:26.180 --> 07:30.840
We will be arriving at the
destination Manila at 3:30 PM.

07:47.200 --> 07:52.600
<i>Naoto Kirihara, psychokinesis
Naoya Kirihara, reading, foresight of the future</i>

08:12.790 --> 08:14.050
Mr. Tsuzuki...

08:14.120 --> 08:15.420
W-What?

08:15.490 --> 08:16.790
Mr. Tsuzuki...

08:16.960 --> 08:18.550
Hey, Mr. Tsuzuki...

08:19.260 --> 08:21.160
You're horrible, Mr. Tsuzuki...

08:21.230 --> 08:23.260
You were mean to me.

08:23.570 --> 08:25.800
You did all the good things to Sakie.

08:25.870 --> 08:27.430
M-Mihoko...

08:27.500 --> 08:29.300
Why are you here?

08:29.740 --> 08:31.370
Come on, Mr. Tsuzuki...

08:31.440 --> 08:32.310
Kazumi?

08:32.380 --> 08:34.430
I already know.

08:34.510 --> 08:37.840
Mr. Tsuzuki, you like
stuff like this, right?

08:40.150 --> 08:46.280
You were always, always doing
perverted things to us in your imagination.

08:48.520 --> 08:52.460
It's okay, Mr. Tsuzuki.
You can do a lot of perverted things.

08:52.760 --> 08:55.030
We love it too.

08:55.330 --> 08:57.530
Look, like this...

09:01.900 --> 09:03.130
Yosuke!

09:04.940 --> 09:06.500
How filthy!

09:06.980 --> 09:10.810
Instead of studying, you were
reading filthy books like these...

09:10.880 --> 09:11.870
Yosuke!

09:11.950 --> 09:14.380
What the heck happened to you!

09:15.490 --> 09:17.540
This child is possessed.

09:18.150 --> 09:21.210
He's possessed by
improper sexual desire!

09:24.760 --> 09:26.250
He's possessed...

09:26.330 --> 09:28.850
He is possessed!

09:28.930 --> 09:29.830
Mom!

09:30.200 --> 09:31.560
How dare...

09:32.170 --> 09:32.770
Mom...

09:32.770 --> 09:33.800
Mom...
How dare you throw me away!

09:33.800 --> 09:35.930
How dare you throw me away!

09:37.470 --> 09:38.270
Yosuke!

09:38.340 --> 09:39.710
I'm going to cut it off!

09:40.110 --> 09:41.310
I'll cut it off!

09:41.310 --> 09:41.870
I'll cut it off!
Stop it!

09:42.210 --> 09:45.180
It's 'cause you have this that
you threw your parents away!

09:49.950 --> 09:51.780
Mr. Tsuzuki, what's the matter!

09:52.290 --> 09:54.720
Is there something wrong
with your body, Mr. Tsuzuki?

09:55.060 --> 09:56.180
Are you okay?

09:59.660 --> 10:02.430
H-Hey, what are you doing?

10:03.670 --> 10:04.890
Stop it!

10:06.740 --> 10:08.000
No!

10:08.300 --> 10:10.600
H-Hey, someone!

10:11.670 --> 10:13.070
No!

10:13.210 --> 10:14.040
Hey!

10:14.140 --> 10:15.540
Hey, get off her!

10:34.200 --> 10:35.260
Ark...

10:35.730 --> 10:39.190
I do not believe at all that our
connection with them has ended.

10:41.540 --> 10:43.130
Quiet days, huh?

10:44.170 --> 10:48.010
I've always been thinking about
what I can do to avoid fighting.

10:48.340 --> 10:50.210
That's all I've been thinking about.

10:50.680 --> 10:53.240
Brother, I'm the same.

10:54.080 --> 10:56.020
I don't want to fight anymore.

11:07.660 --> 11:08.650
What's wrong?

11:14.170 --> 11:15.830
Naoya, what's wrong?

11:17.410 --> 11:18.340
Naoya?

11:31.420 --> 11:32.680
What's wrong, hey!

11:39.130 --> 11:40.100
Naoya!

11:40.560 --> 11:41.500
Futami!

11:41.560 --> 11:43.260
Futami, help me!

11:45.740 --> 11:46.900
What's wrong, Naoya!

11:47.000 --> 11:47.870
Futami!

11:47.940 --> 11:49.030
Hey, Futami!

11:49.110 --> 11:50.330
Answer me!

11:59.050 --> 12:00.310
What's up with that!

12:00.780 --> 12:01.840
I'm very sorry.

12:06.760 --> 12:08.420
Futami, answer me!

12:10.860 --> 12:11.790
Naoya!

12:34.150 --> 12:35.710
Please help...

12:41.260 --> 12:42.590
Mr. Futami?

12:42.890 --> 12:44.380
Please help...

12:44.990 --> 12:48.330
If we don't help her,
it's going to be a disaster.

12:48.800 --> 12:49.790
Who?

12:50.030 --> 12:52.160
That girl, Sakie...

12:52.700 --> 12:53.690
Sakie?

12:54.140 --> 12:55.830
Sakie Amamoto...

13:05.720 --> 13:07.580
Naoya, what's wrong?

13:08.080 --> 13:09.210
What happened?

13:09.390 --> 13:10.510
Hey, Naoya!

13:19.060 --> 13:21.220
Save Sakie?

13:22.000 --> 13:25.930
If Sakie is turned into Ark's hands,
something bad is going to happen.

13:28.400 --> 13:29.700
Please save her.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.400
Take care of Sakie.

13:45.220 --> 13:46.980
Please save Sakie.

13:47.260 --> 13:48.420
Mr. Tsuzuki was...

13:50.360 --> 13:51.660
At the airport...

13:54.560 --> 13:55.500
Hey, Naoya!

13:55.570 --> 13:57.190
Get it together, Naoya!

14:12.780 --> 14:14.220
Sakie...

14:17.690 --> 14:19.780
Why don't you say something?

14:20.890 --> 14:22.860
Mihoko, don't hit the face.

14:22.930 --> 14:25.760
You just need to put
some foundation on later!

14:29.770 --> 14:32.030
You make the face of a weakling...

14:32.100 --> 14:36.900
I know what you were
doing with Tsuzuki here.

14:36.970 --> 14:38.530
Right, Sakie?

14:38.910 --> 14:40.740
You were doing good stuff, right?

14:45.080 --> 14:48.710
What kind of tactics did you use
to seduce your homeroom teacher?

14:51.620 --> 14:54.020
Why don't you tell us, huh?

14:54.220 --> 14:55.690
You whore!

14:56.760 --> 15:00.350
Hey, hey, you're finished already?

15:00.430 --> 15:01.990
You're so sloppy...

15:02.060 --> 15:05.590
When I see your face,
it really pisses me off!

15:09.570 --> 15:10.730
Mihoko!

15:11.140 --> 15:12.660
Don't scare me, stupid!

15:12.740 --> 15:13.710
Tsuzuki was...

15:13.780 --> 15:16.800
Tsuzuki was found at the airport,
and he's at the hospital now.

15:17.910 --> 15:18.940
What?

15:19.120 --> 15:20.480
What do you mean hospital?

15:20.550 --> 15:21.710
What happened?

15:22.150 --> 15:23.880
The police came to the school.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.280
The police?

15:25.350 --> 15:28.720
He's our homeroom teacher,
so they're going to question our class.

15:28.790 --> 15:31.450
If we aren't back, it's going
to be bad! Let's hurry back!

15:32.900 --> 15:33.860
Let's go!

15:49.480 --> 15:50.500
Naoya...

15:51.250 --> 15:52.240
Brother...

15:52.310 --> 15:53.250
Are you okay?

15:53.320 --> 15:54.010
Yeah...

15:54.080 --> 15:55.740
It was so sudden I got worried.

15:55.820 --> 15:56.720
I'm sorry.

15:58.650 --> 16:00.650
It was a school teacher.

16:01.990 --> 16:03.580
Yosuke Tsuzuki...

16:04.590 --> 16:06.560
He was running from Ark.

16:06.860 --> 16:08.020
From Ark?

16:08.660 --> 16:10.790
He betrayed Ark.

16:11.630 --> 16:13.030
And he ran...

16:13.640 --> 16:17.300
Mr. Tsuzuki was trying to
get in contact with Mr. Futami.

16:18.010 --> 16:19.100
Futami, huh?

16:19.410 --> 16:24.640
He was trying to protect a girl
named Sakie Amamoto from Ark.

16:25.080 --> 16:29.780
I was told to not give Sakie to Ark.

16:30.920 --> 16:35.980
If her powers are put in Ark's hands,
something awful is going to happen.

16:36.290 --> 16:37.850
Are you saying we
should go save her?

16:40.200 --> 16:41.130
Yeah...

16:41.700 --> 16:43.130
It will become a battle...

16:43.600 --> 16:44.660
...with Ark...

17:09.760 --> 17:10.850
Brother...

17:17.570 --> 17:20.500
Brother, you should know already.

17:21.300 --> 17:25.170
Even if you run,
it's going to do nothing.

17:25.780 --> 17:29.400
And if you don't go toward the
opponent, nothing will be solved.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.630
You poor thing...

17:49.900 --> 17:51.420
You suffered a lot.

17:51.700 --> 17:52.960
Mr. Tsuzuki...

17:53.200 --> 17:54.730
You poor thing...

18:03.010 --> 18:04.340
Sakie...

18:14.020 --> 18:17.120
Yes, Sakie, come...

18:17.530 --> 18:19.150
Come over here...

18:41.580 --> 18:42.950
Sakie...

18:56.300 --> 18:58.230
I've been waiting for you, Sakie.

18:58.300 --> 19:00.700
Come on, come over here.

19:08.010 --> 19:09.070
Sakie...

19:09.450 --> 19:13.010
Your happiness is over here.

19:50.390 --> 19:53.290
<i>Kirihana Private Academy</i>

19:57.830 --> 20:00.660
It's surrounded by sad emotions.

20:07.940 --> 20:09.700
The air in this place...

20:10.540 --> 20:13.370
I saw it. Sakie and Tsuzuki were...

20:13.580 --> 20:15.870
Really? In the gym storage room?

20:15.950 --> 20:18.310
Every day. They're doing it every day.

20:18.380 --> 20:19.970
So disgusting!

20:20.950 --> 20:23.110
Mr. Tsuzuki, I can't...

20:24.020 --> 20:25.950
I can't deal with this anymore.

20:26.390 --> 20:28.050
I don't want to be alive.

20:38.230 --> 20:40.220
I just want to die.

20:40.470 --> 20:42.840
Mr. Tsuzuki, help me...

20:43.270 --> 20:44.240
Help me...

20:46.840 --> 20:48.140
What's wrong, Naoya?

20:48.640 --> 20:49.870
Water...

20:50.480 --> 20:51.950
It's the pool, Brother!

20:52.650 --> 20:53.310
Naoya?

20:53.380 --> 20:54.820
Over here, Brother!

21:09.200 --> 21:10.060
What!

21:24.210 --> 21:25.370
This is horrible...

21:32.890 --> 21:33.880
Damn it!

21:41.830 --> 21:42.520
Hey!

21:42.600 --> 21:43.660
Brother!

21:49.840 --> 21:51.000
Pull her up!

21:53.240 --> 21:54.900
Hey! Get it together!

21:54.980 --> 21:55.640
Hey!

21:55.840 --> 21:56.710
Brother...

21:56.780 --> 21:59.510
She is Miss Sakie Amamoto.

21:59.780 --> 22:00.810
What!

22:09.760 --> 22:10.920
Brother...

22:20.300 --> 22:21.560
She is...

22:22.170 --> 22:23.430
...Sakie...

22:31.250 --> 22:34.510
<i>An exact answer is nowhere.</i>

22:34.580 --> 22:37.180
<i>Even if you corner it, it still runs.</i>

22:37.250 --> 22:41.850
<i>It's that kind of repeating all the time.</i>

22:41.920 --> 22:45.160
<i>We hurt each other
and rip each other apart.</i>

22:45.230 --> 22:47.860
<i>We're complaining once again.</i>

22:47.930 --> 22:53.270
<i>When tomorrow comes, just like a lie,
you wear a mask and live on.</i>

22:53.340 --> 22:58.640
<i>I was wishing upon
the night stars...</i>

22:58.710 --> 23:03.970
<i>...for our distance
to become shorter.</i>

23:04.050 --> 23:10.680
<i>But if I try to bluff,
then I'm going to regret it.</i>

23:10.750 --> 23:13.220
<i>Words and feelings are reverse.</i>

23:13.290 --> 23:18.850
<i>Feelings that were asleep,
heart that was asleep, lure it out!</i>

23:18.930 --> 23:24.190
<i>Glamour that was asleep, myself
that was asleep, with your power!</i>

23:24.270 --> 23:29.730
<i>Please look at me quietly with the soul
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:29.810 --> 23:34.610
<i>I want you to go wilder inside me.</i>

23:34.680 --> 23:40.140
<i>Eyes that were asleep, emotions
that were asleep, wake them up!</i>

23:40.220 --> 23:45.480
<i>Memories that were asleep, dreams
that were asleep, with your power!</i>

23:45.550 --> 23:51.020
<i>Please melt me with the vision of kindness
that you cannot top more than this.</i>

23:51.090 --> 23:58.190
<i>I want to stay asleep
longer buried inside you.</i>

24:01.500 --> 24:04.200
The sign of destruction that
appears on the water surface.

24:05.710 --> 24:08.300
The happening of amplified emotions.

24:10.380 --> 24:13.840
When the worst-case
scenario of the future...

24:13.920 --> 24:16.380
...stands high in front of us...

24:17.250 --> 24:22.420
We stand against the new evil
who plays with our sealed powers.

24:23.930 --> 24:29.860
<i>Episode 20, "Conciliation"</i>

24:26.560 --> 24:29.000
Where are we headed?
